---
import { funnelSteps, funnel } from '@/data/config';
---

<section id="funnel" class="border-b border-eterea-border bg-[#F8FBFF] py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-14 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="mono inline-block rounded-md bg-blue-100/60 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-eterea-blue">
        ARQUITECTURA DE EXPANSIÓN COMERCIAL
      </div>
      <h2 class="instrument mt-3 text-4xl text-eterea-text sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Expansión continua. <span class="italic text-eterea-blue">De $0 a clientes institucionales.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-eterea-muted sm:text-lg">
        Nuestro motor federado reduce el costo de adquisición marginal a cero. Cada interacción genera datos y confianza que habilitan el siguiente producto de forma natural.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 5-Step Commercial Funnel Cards -->
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
      {funnelSteps.map((step) => (
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#DCE7FF] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition-all hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-md">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="mono rounded bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-eterea-blue">
                {step.step}
              </span>
              <span class="mono text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">
                {step.metric}
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-900">{step.title}</h3>
            <div class="mono mt-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-blue-600">{step.stage}</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{step.detail}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
            <span class="mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">FASE:</span>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-700">{step.stage}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Architectural Connectivity Note -->
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-eterea-blue">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Entrega idempotente y contratos versionados</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
              Cada lead calificado por <strong>Ark Sales</strong> ({funnel.nodes.find(n => n.id === 'sales')?.label}) se sincroniza con reintentos vía cola Outbox y clave única <code class="mono text-blue-600">lead_id</code> directamente hacia Ledger, Angel y Commerce.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/funnel"
          class="shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold text-eterea-blue hover:underline"
        >
          Ver flujo técnico del embudo →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
